{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02371","headline":"杂歌谣辞 邺城童子谣 · 李贺","name":"杂歌谣辞 邺城童子谣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"邺城中，暮尘起。\n将黑丸，斫文吏。\n棘爲鞭，虎爲马。\n团团走，邺城下。\n切玉劒，射日弓。\n献何人，奉相公。\n扶毂来，关右儿。\n香扫涂，相公归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02371.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02371","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}